<name>Engine Control</name>
<ttl id="10006_S000J_744EB_T004X" variety="T004X">
<name>Intake Air Flow Meter Sub-assembly (2AZ-FE)</name>
<para id="RM0000020V1009X" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="065BF-00" from="200612">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM0000020V1009X_02" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM0000020V1009X_02_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___00009HT00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Intake Air Flow Meter Sub-assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Sensor Foreign Matter Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Visually check the platinum filament (heater) in the flow passage.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A154164J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Criteria</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>There must be no visible foreign matter.</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If there is no foreign matter, reinstall the air flow meter to the vehicle after checking.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Intake Air Temperature Sensor Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the connector terminals.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A127786J04" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC2" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Name)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry morerows="2" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1(THA) - 2(E2)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>-20°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>13.6 to 18.4 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>20°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>2.21 to 2.69 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>60°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>0.49 to 0.67 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
